# Urjaa Frontend Environment Configuration
# Production deployed backend: https://urjaa.onrender.com/api/v1 (or https://urjaa.onrender.com)
# Local development: http://localhost:8080/api/v1 (or leave empty for Vite proxy /api/v1)
VITE_API_URL=https://urjaa.onrender.com/api/v1

# Cloudinary Client-Side Configuration
# CRITICAL SECURITY RULE: NEVER include your CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET in this frontend file.
# 1. Sign up / Log in at https://cloudinary.com/
# 2. Find your "Cloud Name" on your dashboard and set it below.
# 3. Create an "Unsigned" Upload Preset under Settings -> Upload -> Upload presets -> Add upload preset (Signing Mode: Unsigned) and set it below.
VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
VITE_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=
